- Multi-tenant data isolation (schemas or per-tenant seeds)
- Region-specific tax rules and promo feature flags
- End-to-end checkout flow with payment gateway and ledger
- Idempotent retries and flaky network handling
- Data seeds and parallel test execution by region
- Observability: verifications via UI, API, and logs

